### Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Preparação: categoria
# @name cat
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Teste {{$randomInt 1000 9999}}" }

### Preparação: autor
# @name aut
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Autor Teste", "nationality": "Brasileira", "birthDate": "1970-01-01" }

### Preparação: livro com 1 exemplar
# @name livroA
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "title": "Livro A", "isbn": "A{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}", "year": 2000, "totalCopies": 1, "categoryId": {{cat.response.body.id}}, "authorIds": [{{aut.response.body.id}}] }

### Preparação: livro com 5 exemplares
# @name livroB
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "title": "Livro B", "isbn": "B{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}", "year": 2001, "totalCopies": 5, "categoryId": {{cat.response.body.id}}, "authorIds": [{{aut.response.body.id}}] }

### Preparação: leitor
# @name leitor
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/readers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Leitor Teste", "cpf": "{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}", "email": "l{{$randomInt 10000 99999}}@email.com", "phone": "44999990000" }

### 1. Emprestar livro A (esperado 201)
# @name emp1
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "bookId": {{livroA.response.body.id}}, "readerId": {{leitor.response.body.id}} }

### 2. Livro A deve ter 0 disponíveis
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books/{{livroA.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Emprestar livro A de novo (esperado 409, sem exemplar)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "bookId": {{livroA.response.body.id}}, "readerId": {{leitor.response.body.id}} }

### 4. Emprestar livro B (esperado 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "bookId": {{livroB.response.body.id}}, "readerId": {{leitor.response.body.id}} }

### 5. Emprestar livro B de novo (esperado 201, leitor com 3 ativos)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "bookId": {{livroB.response.body.id}}, "readerId": {{leitor.response.body.id}} }

### 6. Quarto empréstimo (esperado 409, limite de 3)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "bookId": {{livroB.response.body.id}}, "readerId": {{leitor.response.body.id}} }

### 7. Excluir livro com empréstimo ativo (esperado 409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/books/{{livroA.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. Listar ativos (esperado 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/loans?status=ATIVO
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Devolver o empréstimo 1 (esperado 200, fine 0 e status DEVOLVIDO)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/loans/{{emp1.response.body.id}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Devolver de novo (esperado 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/loans/{{emp1.response.body.id}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 11. Livro A voltou a ter 1 disponível
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/books/{{livroA.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 12. Listar devolvidos (esperado 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/loans?status=DEVOLVIDO
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 13. Status inválido (esperado 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/loans?status=QUALQUER
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 14. Sem token (esperado 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/loans

### 15. Dashboard como admin (esperado 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 16. Histórico do leitor (esperado 200 com os 3 empréstimos)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/readers/{{leitor.response.body.id}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}